SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the xlrcdb tooling only: `src/`, `scripts/`, `test/`, and
the repository configuration.

It does NOT cover the lyric content under `tracks/`, or the artist records
under `artists/`. That content is submitted by contributors. xlrcdb claims no
ownership of it and grants no license to it, and nothing in the MIT license
above should be read as permission to use, copy, or redistribute it.

See LEGAL.md for the full content policy and for how to report content.
